        "original_id": "57f65a6d-79df-5353-b11c-b5dbb36013ca",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Diane Roark, James Risen, Siobhan Gorman\n- Organizations: FBI, NSA, The New York Times, The Baltimore Sun, Central Intelligence Agency\n- Topics: warrantless surveillance, U.S. government activities, abortion debate\n\nFacts:\n- In 2007, armed FBI agents raided Diane Roark's house after she was wrongly suspected of leaking information about NSA warrantless surveillance to James Risen of The New York Times and to Siobhan Gorman of The Baltimore Sun.\n- James Risen has written or co-written many articles about U.S. government activities.\n- James Risen is the author or co-author of two books about the Central Intelligence Agency.\n- James Risen is also the author of a book about the American public debate about abortion.",
